      "pubkey": "dW50cnVzdGVkIGNvbW1lbnQ6IG1pbmlzaWduIHB1YmxpYyBrZXk6IEU3NTUwQzAyQkUzNDM5QkMKUldTOE9UUytBZ3hWNTBlY0UzUDRPS2hoTFJRcm9zWmMwOFBWUnNGNm1jUWpLM3dXSU05THpSZ3gK",
      "endpoints": [
        "https://github.com/cube-drone/ringtome/releases/latest/download/latest.json"
      ]
    }
  }
}
